Package: ethtool-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Franco Conidi <fconidi@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, ethtool, pkexec | policykit-1, systemd
Recommends: network-manager
Description: Graphical interface for Ethernet diagnostics and settings
 ethtool-GUI shows link state, driver information, counters and optical
 diagnostics. It can change supported Ethernet settings, test a cable and
 save selected settings for boot. Link changes have a timed restore safeguard.
